Brightness keys: a step after 3 s of quiet re-reads the monitor first (it can
change behind Caelestia's back), steps queued while a change is being sent add
up, a stepFor IPC ("up" / "down" on one screen, for SHIFT + F1 / F2), and
DDC/CI writes about twice as fast (no read-back; I2C waits x0.3, the LG's
fastest without retries).

